OL,10,G0350FWitness History
OL,11,     GIn 1943 the most audacious hoax
OL,12,     Gof WW2 began. The Nazis
OL,13,     Gdiscovered secret papers on the
OL,14,     Gbody of a British officer washed
OL,15,     Gashore in Spain. They didn't know
OL,16,     Gevery detail was false.
